        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana WB238, 2-3/8 Inch Concave Door Bumper</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Wall Mounted Concave Flush Door Bumper has a 2-3/8 inch diameter. The rubber bumper is concave in the center to accept the locking push button of a door knob/lever, so it will not self lock. It can be used everywhere, from homes to schools to retail shopping malls. It will prevent damage from a door crashing into a wall. Made of solid brass with concealed mounting and available in 8 different finishes. Comes with all mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-WB238U-specifications.gif?v=1704354559\" width=\"299\" height=\"132\" border=\"0\" atl=\"2-3/8 Inch Concave Door Bumper Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana WB238U Solid Brass 2-3/8 Inch Concave Door Bumper:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Rubber: Grey</li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw mounting.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
