                "description": "2-3/8 Inch Concave Door Bumper, Deltana WB238 - The Wall Mounted Concave Flush Door Bumper has a 2-3/8 inch diameter. The rubber bumper is concave in the center to accept the locking push button of a door knob/lever, so it will not self lock. It can be used everywhere, from homes to schools to retail shopping malls. It will prevent damage from a door crashing into a wall. Made of solid brass with concealed mounting and available in 8 different finishes. Comes with all mounting hardware.",
